{"content": "# 『梓川風』\n<figure class=\"float-right\">\n  <img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_basic.webp?v=af507d9a\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/basic.webp?v=16393426\" width=\"1638\" height=\"1638\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1638/1638;\" alt=\"主視覺\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>基礎方塊</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n## 表情\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 200px; --g-rows: 1;\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_expression_confused.webp?v=fc0c0e6a\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/confused.webp?v=e71755fb\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"confused\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>困惑</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_expression_sad.webp?v=59331096\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/sad.webp?v=07abce31\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"sad\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>難過</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_expression_shivering.webp?v=fb550048\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/shivering.webp?v=41ac40a3\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"sad\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>顫抖</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n> (coc7th | OC)  \n\nTag：  \n作家、博士、偵探  \n\n經歷：  \n為了和編輯討論下一部作品而搭上了末班車，結果發生了不可思議的事情。  \n不久後為了新作品的取材而參訪了神秘的研究機構，還沒開始工作就先睡了兩小時，醒來後搜了屍體，跟著大家亂跑。  \n後來推著椅子(好像沒用)、拿了電擊槍跟大家一起面對不可名狀的怪物(伺服器成精了!?)  \n最後打敗了||~~磨死了~~||怪物，旅途就結束了。(所以我說那個取材呢？)\n<—— 現在在這\n\n## 持有物品\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 100px; --g-rows: 1;\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_item_flashlight.webp?v=283fc1c1\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/flashlight.webp?v=c86802da\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 256/256;\" alt=\"flashlight\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>手電筒</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_item_stun.webp?v=f1981144\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/stun.webp?v=894d03e9\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 256/256;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>電擊器</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n## 服裝\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 200px; --g-rows: 1; --g-ratio: 9/16\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_clothing_normal.webp?v=ee67da5b\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/normal.webp?v=1fe20d25\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"flashlight\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>常服</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_clothing_sailor fuku.webp?v=c1a7441a\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/sailor fuku.webp?v=0042a0d2\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>水手服</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/thumb_clothing_travel.webp?v=512f7ab5\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/travel.webp?v=87a57f4c\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>旅途</figcaption></figure>\n</div>", "hashes": {"projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/basic.webp": "7ffb94cb", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/confused.webp": "84d99106", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/sad.webp": "966700e5", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/shivering.webp": "9abe3529", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/flashlight.webp": "ddc590f2", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/stun.webp": "b81f7fab", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/normal.webp": "60f4b61c", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/sailor fuku.webp": "db14e559", "projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/travel.webp": "d0d410a2", "md_source": "19df54b2", "og_cover": "7ffb94cb", "thumb_cover": "7ffb94cb", "art_detail": "b0dbbfcc"}}